00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:50.268
<i>Everyone is welcome.
Everyone is needed.</i>


00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.040
<i>Please join in.</i>


00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.988
<i>Once the climate
crisis has gotten your attention,</i>


00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.120
<i>you can't look away.</i>


00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:13.480
<i>Once you fully understand
the magnitude of the problem,</i>


00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.760
<i>then you can't erase it.</i>


00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.960
<i>I started turning off lights
and pulling out cords at home.</i>


00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:11.308
<i>My parents got very surprised</i>


00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.188
<i>and they wondered
why I did like that.</i>


00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:16.520
<i>And I explained, to save energy.</i>


00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:41.480
<i>My family lived a very
high-consuming lifestyle.</i>


00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:45.600
<i>We bought lots of things,
