00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.760
<i>We drove a petrol
car, we flew all over the world.</i>


00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:03.120
<i>Mom and Dad were
just like everyone else.</i>


00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.440
<i>They didn't understand
