00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:11.280
<i>For many years,
people, especially children</i>


00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:17.760
<i>were very unkind or mean to me.</i>


00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:30.360
<i>I didn't get invited
to parties or celebrations.</i>


00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.760
<i>I was always left out.</i>


00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:45.920
<i>So I spent most of my time
being with my family, and my dogs.</i>


00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:23.028
<i>Time is against us as
UN climate talks begin in Poland</i>


00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:26.388
<i>and is being attended by around
