00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:10.800
"The responsibility is yours, but since..."


00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:16.000
"All of our leaders
are behaving like children..."


00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:17.880
Uh...


00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:20.280
The...


