00:27:01.840 --> 00:27:03.788
Hi, how are you?


00:27:03.800 --> 00:27:06.668
<i>I have to remind all of
us that we have very little time.</i>


00:27:06.680 --> 00:27:09.228
Please, Greta, you have the floor.


00:27:09.240 --> 00:27:11.948
For 25 years, countless people


00:27:11.960 --> 00:27:15.508
have stood in front of the
United Nations Climate Conferences


00:27:15.520 --> 00:27:19.308
