since the emissions just continue to rise.


00:27:25.720 --> 00:27:28.548
So I will not ask them anything.


00:27:28.560 --> 00:27:30.948
Instead, I will ask the people
around the world


00:27:30.960 --> 00:27:34.000
to realize that our
political leaders have failed us.


00:27:35.080 --> 00:27:38.068
Because we are
facing an existential threat.


00:27:38.080 --> 00:27:41.948
And there's no time to
continue down this road of madness.


00:27:41.960 --> 00:27:45.308
We have come here to
let them know that change is coming


00:27:45.320 --> 00:27:47.240
whether they like it or not.


00:27:48.040 --> 00:27:50.868
The people will
rise to the challenge.


00:27:50.880 --> 00:27:53.508
